OL,3,GNEWSAMarshall amps founder, 82, says   
OL,4,Alive music is still his drug           
OL,6,FOctogenarian Terry Marshall has no     
OL,7,Finterest in stepping away from loud    
OL,8,Fgigs.                                  
OL,10,FWhile others his age might prefer peace
OL,11,Fand quiet, the Marshall Amplification  
OL,12,Fco-founder still attends shows to      
OL,13,Fsupport bands in Milton Keynes, where  
OL,14,Fhe lives, and jumps on stage with his  
OL,15,Fsaxophone whenever he gets the chance. 
OL,17,FHe said: "I say at 82, I still want to 
OL,18,Fgo out and get my musical fix.         
OL,20,F"The only drug I've taken is music and 
OL,21,FI can't get away from it."             
